# Optional. Without ~/.config/sketchybar/checks the bar checks every kube context
# in the kubeconfig. Copy this there (per machine, never committed)
# to pick the checks yourself, then reload SketchyBar. One check per line:
# `name | command`, green when the command exits 0 within 10 s. The bar shows
# passed/total; click it for each check.
#
# `kube <context>` checks that the context's token/credentials are still valid.
rancher | kube rancher-prod
eks     | kube eks-dev
# Any shell command works too:
vpn     | nc -z -G 2 10.0.0.1 443
